ecause they are part of trigger words.\n\nThus maybe something like:\n\n{\n  \"description_zh\": \"主题声明锁定：在开展任何创意前，先确定项目坚信的核心；检验主题声明的深度、不可替代性和可持续性。触发词：主题声明、theme statement、它相信什么、价值观锚点、theme lock。\"\n}\n\nThat is concise. It has \"主题声明锁定\" which is the Chinese version of \"Themelock\". But the translation should be concise Chinese. The original description is Chinese already. Actually the description is in Chinese (mixed with English trigger words). The user wants translationto Chinese, presumably refine it to concise Chinese. The description is already Chinese, but the user may want a moreconcise Chinese translation.\n\nThus we produce JSON with \"description_zh\". Provide concise Chinese translation.\n\nThus the final answer: {\"description_zh\":\"主题声明锁定：在创意展开前，先锁定项目核心信念；验证主题声明的深度、不可替代性和可持续性。触发词：主题声明、theme statement、它相信什么、价值观锚点、theme lock。\"} That's fine.\n\nWe must return only JSON. Let's do that.\n</think>\n\n```json\n{\"description_zh\":\"主题声明锁定：在创意展开前，先锁定项目核心信念；验证主题声明的深度、不可替代性和可持续性。触发词：主题声明、theme statement、它相信什么、价值观锚点、theme lock。\"}\n```", "downloads": 65, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/huangliujiao-tal/planner-theme-lock", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "主题声明锁定", "ownerName": "huangliujiao-tal", "score": 1923.6460491269606, "slug": "planner-theme-lock", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780714493984, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1780554987209, "description": "Prerender (prerender.io). Use this skill for ANY Prerender request — reading, creating, updating, and deleting data. Whenever a task involves Prerender, use...", "description_zh": "Prerender (prerender.io)，用于处理所有 Prerender 请求（读取、创建、更新、删除数据），任何涉及 Prerender 的任务均使用此技能。", "downloads": 65, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/oomol/oo-prerender", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "Prerender", "ownerName": "oomol", "score": 14069.26406926407, "slug": "oo-prere